## Error recovery (error text -> exact next command)
"codex: command not found" -> command -v codex ; report that Codex is not on PATH
unknown codex flag/subcommand -> codex --help or codex SUBCOMMAND --help, copy the exact syntax, retry once
missing imp command -> inspect package.json bin entries and ~/.bun/bin links, then report the missing link or executable
bun test failure -> report the failing test and rerun the narrow relevant test once after a focused fix
permission/auth error -> ls -la "$HOME/.codex" and report presence/permissions only; do not read auth secrets
dirty worktree before edits -> git status --short --branch, preserve unrelated changes and edit only requested files

